    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "portal-label",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 460,
      "text": "PORTAL SYSTEM (PWA - Offline First)\n\nRole-Based Dashboards:\n🎓 HEADMASTER: Overview, approvals, alerts, reports\n👨‍🏫 ASST HEAD: Academic ops, teacher mgmt\n💰 BURSAR: Fees, payments, MoMo, payroll, expenses\n📚 ACADEMIC COORD: Terms, timetable, curriculum, SBA\n👩‍🏫 CLASS TEACHER: Attendance, scores, reports, parents\n📖 SUBJECT TEACHER: Score entry, schemes\n📋 REGISTRAR: Admissions, student records, comms\n👨‍👩‍👧 PARENT: View-only (reports, fees, messages)\n\nCore Modules:\n📊 Student Management (CRUD + 360° profile)\n👥 Staff Management (accounts, roles, contracts, leave)\n📅 Academic Structure (Terms, Classes, Subjects, Streams)\n⏰ Timetable Builder (drag-drop, conflicts)\n📖 NaCCA Curriculum Map (B1-B12)\n📝 Assessment & SBA (entry, review, approval)\n📈 Terminal Reports (PDF, customizable)\n⬆️ Promotion Workflow (propose→approve→execute)\n✅ Attendance (daily/period, alerts, reports)\n📝 Behaviour Logging (types, severity, actions)\n💰 Finance (fee struct, invoices, payments, MoMo)\n💬 Communication Hub (in-app, email, SMS, WhatsApp, push)\n📊 Reports Engine (academic, finance, attendance, custom)\n🔄 Sync Engine (Yjs + IndexedDB, CRDT, conflict resolution)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "portal",
      "originalText": "PORTAL SYSTEM (PWA - Offline First)\n\nRole-Based Dashboards:\n🎓 HEADMASTER: Overview, approvals, alerts, reports\n👨‍🏫 ASST HEAD: Academic ops, teacher mgmt\n💰 BURSAR: Fees, payments, MoMo, payroll, expenses\n📚 ACADEMIC COORD: Terms, timetable, curriculum, SBA\n👩‍🏫 CLASS TEACHER: Attendance, scores, reports, parents\n📖 SUBJECT TEACHER: Score entry, schemes\n📋 REGISTRAR: Admissions, student records, comms\n👨‍👩‍👧 PARENT: View-only (reports, fees, messages)\n\nCore Modules:\n📊 Student Management (CRUD + 360° profile)\n👥 Staff Management (accounts, roles, contracts, leave)\n📅 Academic Structure (Terms, Classes, Subjects, Streams)\n⏰ Timetable Builder (drag-drop, conflicts)\n📖 NaCCA Curriculum Map (B1-B12)\n📝 Assessment & SBA (entry, review, approval)\n📈 Terminal Reports (PDF, customizable)\n⬆️ Promotion Workflow (propose→approve→execute)\n✅ Attendance (daily/period, alerts, reports)\n📝 Behaviour Logging (types, severity, actions)\n💰 Finance (fee struct, invoices, payments, MoMo)\n💬 Communication Hub (in-app, email, SMS, WhatsApp, push)\n📊 Reports Engine (academic, finance, attendance, custom)\n🔄 Sync Engine (Yjs + IndexedDB, CRDT, conflict resolution)",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "shared",
      "x": 850,
