    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "shared-label",
      "x": 870,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 460,
      "text": "SHARED PACKAGES\n\n• shared-types: Zod schemas, TypeScript types\n• shared-ui: Design system (Radix + Tailwind v4)\n• shared-utils: Date, currency (GHS), validation\n• sync-engine: Yjs/Automerge, IndexedDB, queue\n• auth: RBAC, permissions, sessions, MFA\n• database: Prisma schema + migrations\n• ghana-education: GES/NaCCA curriculum, grading\n• reports: PDF (React-PDF), Excel (ExcelJS)\n• notifications: Email, SMS, Push, WhatsApp\n• testing: Vitest, Playwright, MSW handlers",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "shared",
      "originalText": "SHARED PACKAGES\n\n• shared-types: Zod schemas, TypeScript types\n• shared-ui: Design system (Radix + Tailwind v4)\n• shared-utils: Date, currency (GHS), validation\n• sync-engine: Yjs/Automerge, IndexedDB, queue\n• auth: RBAC, permissions, sessions, MFA\n• database: Prisma schema + migrations\n• ghana-education: GES/NaCCA curriculum, grading\n• reports: PDF (React-PDF), Excel (ExcelJS)\n• notifications: Email, SMS, Push, WhatsApp\n• testing: Vitest, Playwright, MSW handlers",
      "autoResize": true
    },
