    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "sync-label",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "OFFLINE-FIRST SYNC ARCHITECTURE\n\nClient (Browser PWA):\n• IndexedDB (SQLite via sql.js WASM)\n• Service Worker (cache, background sync, push)\n• Yjs CRDT for collaborative editing\n• Local-first writes → SyncLog queue\n\nSync Engine:\n• Operation queue (batched, ordered)\n• Conflict detection (vector clocks)\n• Resolution strategies per entity:\n  - Attendance: Server wins (timestamp)\n  - Grades: Manual review queue\n  - Payments: Server wins (immutable)\n  - Student/Staff: Field-level merge\n  - Messages: Append-only\n  - Tasks: Field-level merge\n• Retry with exponential backoff\n• BroadcastChannel for multi-tab sync\n\nServer (Supabase):\n• PostgreSQL + Realtime subscriptions\n• Edge Functions for webhooks (MoMo)\n• Row-Level Security (multi-tenant ready)\n• Point-in-time recovery\n\nIntranet Deployment:\n• Docker Compose: Postgres, Redis, Next.js, Nginx, MinIO\n• Runs on Raspberry Pi 5 / Mini PC\n• Auto-sync when internet detected",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "sync",
      "originalText": "OFFLINE-FIRST SYNC ARCHITECTURE\n\nClient (Browser PWA):\n• IndexedDB (SQLite via sql.js WASM)\n• Service Worker (cache, background sync, push)\n• Yjs CRDT for collaborative editing\n• Local-first writes → SyncLog queue\n\nSync Engine:\n• Operation queue (batched, ordered)\n• Conflict detection (vector clocks)\n• Resolution strategies per entity:\n  - Attendance: Server wins (timestamp)\n  - Grades: Manual review queue\n  - Payments: Server wins (immutable)\n  - Student/Staff: Field-level merge\n  - Messages: Append-only\n  - Tasks: Field-level merge\n• Retry with exponential backoff\n• BroadcastChannel for multi-tab sync\n\nServer (Supabase):\n• PostgreSQL + Realtime subscriptions\n• Edge Functions for webhooks (MoMo)\n• Row-Level Security (multi-tenant ready)\n• Point-in-time recovery\n\nIntranet Deployment:\n• Docker Compose: Postgres, Redis, Next.js, Nginx, MinIO\n• Runs on Raspberry Pi 5 / Mini PC\n• Auto-sync when internet detected",
      "autoResize": true
    },
